1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,719
This is the good stuff I told you guys about.
I'm telling you— it's 100% delicious.

2
00:00:09,719 --> 00:00:14,400
This place?
I'm serious.

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:20,039
KW Pizza…
Why does this place look so familiar?

4
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,937
Earth, you're here for pizza?

5
00:00:34,937 --> 00:00:37,071
Didn't you say you came to help my dad?

6
00:00:37,071 --> 00:00:40,831
Earth— it's not what you think.
Earth… Earth, hey—

7
00:00:40,831 --> 00:00:44,285
Earth.

8
00:00:44,285 --> 00:00:46,617
Gun, what is this?

9
00:00:46,617 --> 00:00:48,815
Let's just go— yeah, yeah, let's go.

10
00:00:49,826 --> 00:00:53,332
When the hell am I gonna get to eat?
I brought you here, damn it.

11
00:00:53,332 --> 00:00:56,760
Earth—

12
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:02,000
Earth. It's not what you think—
I just came to pick up pizza.

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,247
So what? Whether you're here for pizza or
here for something else— that's none of my business.

14
00:01:07,247 --> 00:01:12,880
I'm going back to stay with my mom.
You and Kwan aren't a thing, right?

15
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:16,661
Earth, you're overthinking this.
Do you still not trust me?

16
00:01:17,634 --> 00:01:19,257
You tell me to trust you—

17
00:01:19,257 --> 00:01:23,698
Trust you about what?
And why didn't you tell me about your uncle?

18
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:27,315
Earth— you already know?

19
00:01:29,661 --> 00:01:31,437
Did the housekeeper tell you?

20
00:01:32,276 --> 00:01:35,529
I met P'Paeng on the BTS. She told me.

21
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:41,309
And did she tell you anything else?
What— you scared she'll expose your secrets?

22
00:01:42,492 --> 00:01:45,006
Earth, I'm talking nicely here—

23
00:01:45,006 --> 00:01:50,003
Besides the thing about your uncle,
she also said you and Kwan's brother—

24
00:01:50,003 --> 00:01:52,454
She really said that?

25
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,390
How can you "look after Kwan's feelings"
when you're dating me?

26
00:01:58,619 --> 00:02:03,397
Because other people don't know about us.
Why do you care what they think?

27
00:02:04,084 --> 00:02:07,860
All you need to know is
I love you. Isn't that enough?

28
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:13,793
I'm not so sure. I'm scared.
Scared of what, Earth?

29
00:02:13,793 --> 00:02:19,827
Why didn't you tell me about your uncle?
If I had told you, wouldn't you overthink it?

30
00:02:19,999 --> 00:02:24,727
Earth would overthink,
and Earth would blame himself.

31
00:02:25,376 --> 00:02:27,668
And you think I'm not overthinking now?

32
00:02:27,878 --> 00:02:33,807
Okay… I'm sorry.
I'm really sorry.
